{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670290/extras/Description_dragons.png?t=1745566706\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong>Dragons Frolic!</strong> you collect little dragons, which you can enter into dragon races.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customise your character.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy cute little dragons frolicking around you!\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover different types of dragons and their color variations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Decorate your dragons sheds.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Breed, raise and sell dragons.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Send your favorite dragons into races, collect treasure and unlock new race tracks.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Races are side-scrollers! Compete in different modes. Beat a level as fast as you can or keep on running for as long as possible.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670290/extras/dragon_crowned.gif?t=1745566706\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3670290?t=1745566706","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670290/d1e736c7d4f4c9307dd4660a4ed3ee5f103fb4a3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745566706","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670290/7782b27ca8baeacd890555e42123aaa707c9f367/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745566706","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670290/7782b27ca8baeacd890555e42123aaa707c9f367/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745566706","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id